  (.spk=race coast=1|river=1) rowing
  (.spk=race cold=1) ice race
bc.sp.unit (people=1)
  goals
  points
  runs
bc.sp.where (people=3)
  in the rain
  in front of a full ground
  after extra time
  with the last kick
  on a frozen pitch
  before a silent crowd
bc.sp.how (share=0.6)
  Their supporters were seen in {bc.sp.streets} until {bc.sp.till}.
  The match was stopped for {#n|hour} by {weather.now}.
  It was {city}'s first {bc.sp.what} in {#n|season}.
  The crowd of {#nbig} went home {bc.sp.happy}.
  The referee needed an escort to {bc.sp.esc}.
  {bc.sp.who} {bc.sp.did}.
  Nobody had expected it, least of all {bc.sp.least}.
