  the fountains
  the {drink} houses
  the squares
bc.sp.till (people=2)
  morning
  the trams stopped
  the police came
bc.sp.what
  loss
  win
  draw
bc.sp.happy (people=3)
  happy
  soaked
  hoarse
  early
  singing the {festival} songs
bc.sp.esc (people=2)
  the station
  the river
  the gate
bc.sp.who (people=2)
  The captain
  The keeper
  The new player from {city2}
  A girl from {$home}
bc.sp.did (people=3)
  scored twice
  was carried off
  was sent off
  scored with the last kick
  wept on the field
